      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Al Hassan Bin Mahboub, from Jameel, from Murazim, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘Allah<sup>azwj</sup> has not been worshipped with anything more superior than the fulfilling of the rights of the <span class=\"iTxt\">Momin</span>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "4. It is narrated from him (narrator of the Hadith above) from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from al-Hassan ibn Mahbub from Jamil from Marazim from abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) who has said the following: “Allah the best way to worship is to fulfil (protect) the rights of the believer.” "
        ]
      }
